- T2 **KILLSHOT:** 2 AP, 5 Stam. Attack at +6 damage against a target that has not moved since your last turn; requires Focused stance or no movement.
- T3 **ONE SHOT, ONE KILL:** 2 AP, 7 Stam. Attack at +8 damage; if the target is below 50% HP on hit, they must make a FOR save or die (creatures immune to instant death take +50% damage instead).
