- T2 **ARROW STORM:** 2 AP, 5 Stam. Rain arrows on a 4m radius area at weapon range; all creatures in the area take weapon damage +2, AGI save for half.
- T3 **HAIL OF DEATH:** 3 AP, 8 Stam. Bombard a 5m radius area; all creatures take weapon damage +6, AGI save for half, and the area becomes difficult terrain for 2 rounds.
- T4 **LIVING ARTILLERY:** Passive. Area attacks gain +1 radius. Enemies that start their turn in your area effects take 4 damage. You can maintain one suppression zone as a free action.

