**MECHANICAL BARRAGE** | 3 AP | 6 Stamina | Range: weapon
Fire a rapid volley of four bolts at up to four targets; each bolt deals weapon damage +2, and any target hit twice must FOR save or be Staggered (-2 all rolls, 1 round).
*Unlock: T3 Scroll, Master, OR "Hit 4 different enemies with crossbow attacks across your career"*

