- T2 **CONCUSSIVE BLOW:** 2 AP, 4 Stam. Slam shield into target's head for 2d6 + FOR damage; WIL save or Dazed (-2 all rolls) for 1 round.
- T3 **AVALANCHE RUSH:** 3 AP, 6 Stam. Charge up to double movement, hitting every enemy in your path for 2d6 + FOR damage; each target AGI save or prone.
- T4 **SHIELD MASTER:** Passive. Shield attacks deal full weapon-equivalent damage (use shield DEF bonus as base damage die). Shield Bash no longer ends your turn.

## Variant C: PROTECTOR
*Modifier: Can intercept attacks on adjacent allies, -1 to own DEF when protecting*

**Unique Techniques:**
