- T2 **SACRIFICIAL BLOCK:** Reaction, 4 Stam. Take an attack meant for an adjacent ally; reduce the damage you receive by your shield's DEF bonus.
- T3 **PHALANX COMMAND:** 2 AP, 6 Stam. All allies within 3m gain your shield's DEF bonus for 2 rounds; you take -2 DEF during this time.
- T4 **UNDYING GUARDIAN:** Passive. When an ally within 3m would drop to 0 HP, you may take the remaining damage instead (once per rest). Allies adjacent to you cannot be critically hit.

