**PRESSURE POINT EXPLOIT** | 1 AP | 3 Stamina | *Tag: Exploit (any debuff)*
Strike a precise pressure point on a debilitated target. If the target has any debuff condition (Bleeding, Burning, Poisoned, Dazed, Slowed, Frightened), deal weapon damage and the debuff's remaining duration doubles (max +3 rounds added). If the target has no debuff, deal weapon damage -2.
